 "_doc": "Per-level intro films (v2: title -> caption-free overview -> the rogue AI -> objective -> GO on the player's start view). 'capture' drives scripts/capture-level-flythrough.mjs (camera shots in Doom units, per-tic splines; guardian paths; 'player' shots sit on the player's own spawn view; vertical reuses the landscape shots with its own fov/fps). New captures go to doom-web/local/intro/levels/raw-v2/; the v1 footage in raw/ is only read. 'film' drives scripts/build-level-intros.py: 'span' = [start, end] seconds of a captured shot. Names come from the game code: doom-mod/actors/PDControlMap.zs / PDHalMap.zs SiteName, NamedCast.zs sprites."
}